---
title: "corsConfig (stem-bot-v2: src/index.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_env: ALLOWED_ORIGINS = process.env.ALLOWED_ORIGINS
    q_check_env --> q_split: ALLOWED_ORIGINS is set
    q_check_env --> q_wildcard: ALLOWED_ORIGINS not set
    q_split --> q_apply: origin = ALLOWED_ORIGINS.split(,)
    q_wildcard --> q_apply: origin = *
    q_apply --> [*]: app.use(cors(corsOptions))

    note right of q_wildcard
        INV-001: Default CORS origin is * (all origins) when ALLOWED_ORIGINS not set
        INV-002: credentials true with origin * is a permissive CORS configuration
        INV-003: maxAge 86400 caches preflight for 24 hours
    end note
